{"id":37711,"vol":{"id":4724,"name":"Batman: Shadow of the Bat"},"num":"16","name":"The God of Fear, Part One of Three","title":"Batman: Shadow of the Bat #16","year":"1993","date":"1993-09-30","store":"","poster":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_medium/0/4/33770-4724-37711-1-batman-shadow-of-th.jpg","big":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_large/0/4/33770-4724-37711-1-batman-shadow-of-th.jpg","pub":"DC Comics","deck":"","desc":"Professor Jonathan Crane engineered an experiment at a Gotham college under an assumed name. Anarky broke out of a juvenile detention center and decided that Batman had created all his enemies, therefore should be taken down. Jean Paul Valley went out as Batman. Scarecrow's experiment left his subjects under his complete control. Together, they went on a rampage.\n\nNotes:","people":[{"id":30188,"name":"Adrienne Roy","role":"colorist"},{"id":42472,"name":"Alan Grant","role":"writer"},{"id":5102,"name":"Bret Blevins","role":"penciler"},{"id":3767,"name":"Brian Stelfreeze","role":"artist, cover"},{"id":40861,"name":"Dennis O'Neil","role":"editor"},{"id":45110,"name":"Jordan B. Gorfinkel","role":"editor"},{"id":4676,"name":"Mike Manley","role":"inker"},{"id":6224,"name":"Todd Klein","role":"letterer"},{"id":67476,"name":"Typeset","role":"letterer"}],"chars":[{"id":1702,"name":"Joker","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/11156/111564182/10110910-latest.jpg"},{"id":9290,"name":"Tim Drake","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/11156/111564182/9852320-tdrakeb01.jpg"},{"id":5555,"name":"Two-Face","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/11174/111743204/9507444-baldemarrivas.jpg"}],"arcs":[{"id":40761,"name":"\"Batman\" Knightfall"}]}